                    "value": "This KPI evaluates diagnosis claims over a 5-year lookback for all patients in Patient360, flagging claims with predefined ICD-10 codes indicating clinically severe conditions. Severity is determined based on distinct service dates with such codes: patients with ≥2 dates are classified as Severe , while those with fewer are Attenuated . \"NOTE:  Business rules to define severity are in the process of being refined\"",
